            <ArticleTitle>Hemorrhage into a choledochal cyst in a hemophiliac child.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>118-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A hemophiliac child presented with acute abdominal pain due to hemorrhage into an unsuspected choledochal cyst. Sonography delineated the cystic mass; hepatobiliary scintigraphy confirmed the diagnosis.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
